sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Pipeline
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as KServe Webhook<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as kserve-controller-manager
    participant LLMCtrl as llmisvc-controller
    participant LocalCtrl as localmodel-controller
    participant NodeAgent as localmodelnode-agent
    participant StorageInit as storage-initializer<br/>Init Container
    participant Cloud as Cloud Storage<br/>S3/GCS/Azure/HF
    participant Gateway as Gateway<br/>HTTPRoute
    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pod<br/>vLLM/OVMS/MLServer
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over User, Client: Flow 1: InferenceService Deployment
    User->>K8sAPI: Create InferenceService CR<br/>Bearer Token / kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutate + Validate<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Approved
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service, HTTPRoute<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Note over StorageInit: Init container starts
    StorageInit->>Cloud: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / OAuth
    Cloud-->>StorageInit: Model artifacts
    Note over ModelServer: Model server starts after init
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>ModelServer: Route via HTTPRoute<br/>TLS
    ModelServer-->>Gateway: Prediction response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over User, Client: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService Deployment
    User->>K8sAPI: Create LLMInferenceService CR<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutate + Validate (LLM)<br/>TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Approved
    K8sAPI-->>LLMCtrl: Watch event
    LLMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment/LWS, HPA/ScaledObject,<br/>HTTPRoute, InferencePool, NetworkPolicy
    Client->>Gateway: LLM inference request<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>ModelServer: HTTPRoute -> InferencePool<br/>Load-balanced routing
    ModelServer-->>Client: LLM response

    Note over User, Client: Flow 3: Local Model Caching
    User->>K8sAPI: Create LocalModelCache CR<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>LocalCtrl: Watch event
    LocalCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PV, PVC, download Job<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Note over StorageInit: Download Job runs storage-initializer
    StorageInit->>Cloud: Download model to PV<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Cloud-->>StorageInit: Model artifacts
    NodeAgent->>K8sAPI: Update LocalModelNode status<br/>ServiceAccount token
